Description: enhanced Motif window manager
 EMWM is a lightweight, standalone window manager derived from the Motif
 Window Manager. It retains the traditional Motif appearance and resource
 configuration model while adding multiple workspaces, Xinerama and Xrandr
 support, UTF-8/Xft text rendering, and relevant EWMH functionality.
